          <change when="2011-12-02T08:42:07.764-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/simoeis">Vote - AcceptText - Ln8: --&gt;&lt;:τὸ \προσ/ορμοῦν|corr|τὸν \προσ/ορμοῦντ[α]:&gt;</change>
          <change when="2011-12-02T08:42:07.757-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/joshuad.sosin">Vote - AcceptText - Accept. Lin4--&gt; σιτολόγο[ι] .2; lin9 handle in reg; lin10 since the placement in the line seems clear enough I'd prefer: 10. &lt;:\λοιπὸν/ ἢ ἀποστείλατε ὑποδέκτην|corr|ἢ ἀποστείλατε \λοιπὸν/ ὑποδέκτην:&gt;</change>
